      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "<!--- Verify first that your feature was not already discussed on GitHub -->\r\n<!--- Complete *all* sections as described, this form is processed automatically -->\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\nSimply allow the remove_others flag like the apt_repo module\r\n\r\n##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n- Feature Idea\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\napt_repository \r\n\r\n##### ADDITIONAL INFORMATION\r\nWe use apt_repository a lot, however sometimes we want to update the repo to support higher version. e.g.\r\n\r\ndeb https://deb.nodesource.com/node_8.x stretch main\r\ndeb-src https://deb.nodesource.com/node_8.x stretch main\r\n\r\nHas to become:\r\ndeb https://deb.nodesource.com/node_10.x stretch main\r\ndeb-src https://deb.nodesource.com/node_10.x stretch main\r\n\r\nUnfortunately now this change in version always results in:\r\n\r\ndeb https://deb.nodesource.com/node_8.x stretch main\r\ndeb-src https://deb.nodesource.com/node_8.x stretch main\r\ndeb https://deb.nodesource.com/node_10.x stretch main\r\ndeb-src https://deb.nodesource.com/node_10.x stretch main\r\n\r\nWhich is not what we expect. We need to get rid of any other contents in this file.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
